            "review_title": "Review at Moku Japanese Restaurant",
            "review_text": "PaulSaigon\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam83 contributions\n0\nSuper super super expensive....\nMay 2020\nSuper super super expensive.... nothing exciting in spite of the fact I informed the staff that I perfectly know what does Japanese quality food mean..... \nAll the fish was only basic fish nothing exciting and the cuts are very very small.... almost to supplying kids..... \nNo matter of facts that the owner is Vietnamese and according to what I ate.... I am not even sure that he had good Japanese food before he opened this restaurant..... \nI can understand why there is no fish displayed and why there is no customers in the restaurant. \nDisaster discovery\nRead more\nWritten May 24, 2020",
